Disco is a fork of MangoDisk. Most of the application (Vue frontend, Tauri
adapter, Rust Core and platform crates, cleanup rule library) originates from
MangoDisk and has been modified by Disco contributors. The MangoDisk name and
logo are not used as Disco's brand.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Bulk Crap Uninstaller (BCU)
https://github.com/BCUninstaller/Bulk-Crap-Uninstaller
Copyright 2017 Marcin Szeniak
License: Apache License, Version 2.0

Disco's helper (helpers/disco-bcu-helper) is built against BCU libraries
(UninstallTools, KlocTools, ObjectListView) and ships BCU's read-only query
helpers (SteamHelper, StoreAppHelper, OculusHelper, ScriptHelper), from the
commit pinned in helpers/bcu/bcu.lock.json. BCU sources are not stored in this
repository. Disco applies a few minimal patches at build time (listed in
helpers/bcu/README.md); each modified file keeps BCU's copyright header and is
marked "Modified by Disco". Builds ship BCU's license and NOTICE as
BCU-LICENSE.txt and BCU-NOTICE.txt. Apache-2.0 code is combined with Disco under
GPL-3.0-only as permitted by both licenses.

